#. module: hr_timesheet_nonbillable
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_timesheet_nonbillable/models/hr_timesheet_nonbillable.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"                <p class=\"o_view_nocontent_smiling_face\">\n"
"                    Record timesheets\n"
"                </p><p>\n"
"                    You can register and track your workings hours by "
"project every\n"
"                    day. Every time spent on a project will become a cost "
"and can be re-invoiced to\n"
"                    customers if required.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                <p class=\"o_view_nocontent_smiling_face\">\n"
"                    Registrera tidrapporter\n"
"                </p> <p>\n"
"                    Du kan registrera och spåra dina arbetstimmar per "
"projekt varje\n"
"                    dag. Varje tid som spenderas på ett projekt blir till "
"en kostnad och kan vidarefaktureras till\n"
"                    kunder om så krävs.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

